Checked against `direction/delivery-spec.md`, `script.csv`, `shotlist.csv` (director 137f8d6 / direction-v3).
Method: downloaded `cut-v2-elephants-dream.mp4` and `.en.vtt` from the release; sha256 of the mp4 235ffd57…8611f equals editor `film/elephants-dream.mp4`; the vtt is byte-identical. ffmpeg 7.0.2 (decode, ebur128, volumedetect, silencedetect, frame grabs), numpy sample analysis, whisper small.en (faster-whisper, int8, CPU; transcript in `evidence/cut-v2/asr-whisper-small-en.json`) for what is audible where. I did not play the file in a browser or listen with ears; "intelligible" below is judged by a speech recogniser, which is a proxy.

